window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I’m her Royal Guard - I’m not supposed to be in love with her.</p> <p>I’ve watched over Princess Waverly for years, done my duty, protected the woman who is second in line for the crown. But I’ve got a secret. She’s the one woman I can’t stop thinking about and when she’s kidnapped during a charity ball, I’ll stop at nothing to save her.</p> <p>Waverly isn’t just the people’s princess, she’s my everything, and I’ll do whatever it takes to keep her.</p>"; 
